From: Dreeam <61569423+Dreeam-qwq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 2 Nov 2024 04:15:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Reuse cached Moonrise chunk keys

Read the precomputed key in CoordinateUtils when a ChunkPos is already available. Preserve the other overloads and the signed coordinate packing used by existing callers.

Original patch: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0158-Cache-chunk-key.patch

diff --git a/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/util/CoordinateUtils.java b/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/util/CoordinateUtils.java
index 47d2f0cd01619cb6ba4eed7145aeaf573141d047..16a32af38618cc958896f774e8b1877ad9e8aa55 100644
--- a/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/util/CoordinateUtils.java
+++ b/src/main/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/common/util/CoordinateUtils.java
@@ -17,11 +17,11 @@ public final class CoordinateUtils {
 
     public static long getChunkKey(final Entity entity) {
         final ChunkPos pos = entity.chunkPosition();
-        return ((long)pos.z() << 32) | (pos.x() & 0xFFFFFFFFL);
+        return pos.longKey(); // Leaf - Cache chunk key
     }
 
     public static long getChunkKey(final ChunkPos pos) {
-        return ((long)pos.z() << 32) | (pos.x() & 0xFFFFFFFFL);
+        return pos.longKey(); // Leaf - Cache chunk key
     }
 
     public static long getChunkKey(final SectionPos pos) {
